  "title": "Senjou no Valkyria: Valkyria Chronicles",
  "justification": "AniDB specials S11 and S12, the PS3 and PSP gameplay cast battles (2009), have no TVDB episode; by default they fell on TVDB season 0 episodes 11 and 12, the 2011 OVA \"Unrecorded Chronicles\" (AniDB 8158). S1-S10 stay on episodes 1-10, the \"Gallian Chronicles\" shorts and the Extra. On TMDB 24392 season 0, S10 \"Extra\" (2010-04-07) is episode 12 (2010-04-07, 3 minutes), while episodes 10 and 11 are the OVA; S11-S21 (gameplay, radio reports and live footage) have no TMDB episode. Those are unmapped there.",
